cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model, please cite it as below."
title: "U.S. County Housing Needs Forecasting Model"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-01-01   # replace with the release date
authors:
  - family-names: "Oduro"
    given-names: "Gideon"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-9593-094X"   # replace or remove
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kojo61/county-housing-forecast"
abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible county-level model of 5- and 10-year housing needs for the
  United States: cohort-component population projection, household formation by
  tenure and HUD income band, housing-unit requirement, expected supply from the
  authorized construction pipeline, and the resulting gap, validated by historical
  back-tests against benchmark forecasts.
keywords:
  - housing needs
  - population projection
  - cohort-component
  - household formation
  - small-area forecasting
